      <activity id="5727ee3f-426a-57c6-99c1-cea72d8fe47f" activityNameId="1f615ca4-980d-5516-8288-44470ff5d909" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Glued laminated timber, outdoor use, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Glued laminated timber, outdoor use, at plant
The multi-output process "glued laminated timber, outdoor use, production" delivers the two coproducts "glued laminated timber, outdoor use, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, GLT production, outdoor use, u=10%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: 1ead72b8-b3e9-3d5a-8c28-7a2c0182e32c
Includes the inputs to the production processes, transports of those inputs and the process emissions as far as they are available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Estimate based on data for three layered laminated board
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for the product and the region is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1ead72b8-b3e9-3d5a-8c28-7a2c0182e32c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
